="card-kicker">BUSINESS · ${x[3]}</div><h3>${x[0]}</h3><p>${x[2]}</p><button ${S.gold<x[4]||S.business.some(b=>b.name===x[0])?'disabled':''} onclick="buyBusiness(${i})">${S.business.some(b=>b.name===x[0])?'Already owned':`Open · ${x[4]} ◈`}</button></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="panel wide-panel"><div class="section-row"><h2 class="section-title">The noble court</h2><span class="relation">${esc(S.title)}</span></div><p class="notice">Nobility is earned through deeds, standing, and the favor of the court. Build a reputation and bring a worthy offering.</p><div class="event"><div class="event-mark">♜</div><div class="event-text"><b style="color:#e9dfc5">Petition for a title</b><time>${S.title==='Commoner'?'Requires 30 crowns and reputation 25, or two land holdings.':S.title==='Landed Gentry'?'Earn more renown and petition for a higher title.':'Your title is recognized throughout the Marches.'}</time></div><button class="primary" style="margin:0" onclick="petitionTitle()" ${S.title==='Noble'?'disabled':''}>${S.title==='Noble'?'Highest rank':'Petition · '+rankCost+' ◈'}</button></div></div>`}
