esses named you to the reeve; the Marches will not forget.`,'☠️');toast('The reeve has begun asking questions.')}else{log(`${p.name} was killed. No one can prove what happened, but the silence weighs on you.`,'☠️');toast('A choice you cannot undo.')};update()}},{label:'Step away',note:'No one is harmed',run:()=>toast('You chose not to cross that line.') }])}}])}
